---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
const notes = (await getCollection("fieldnotes")).sort((a, b) => +b.data.date - +a.data.date).slice(0, 3);
---
<Base
  title="Together, make it happen"
  description="For Better Community USA is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit incorporated in Montana, working with communities in Central America and the Caribbean toward self-sufficiency."
  hero={true}
  heroImage="/img/tegucigalpa-market.jpg"
>
  <div slot="hero" class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="eyebrow text-cyan">501(c)(3) nonprofit · Montana</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] mt-4">
      We succeed on the day a community no longer needs us.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      For Better Community works with small communities in Central America and the Caribbean,
      where a modest, well-placed intervention changes what a family can do for itself.
      Not aid that maintains. Capacity that stays.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
      <a href="/our-work/" class="navlink bg-cyan px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white hover:text-navy transition-colors">See our work</a>
      <a href="/governance/" class="navlink border border-white/40 px-6 py-3 hover:border-cyan hover:text-cyan transition-colors">Who we are</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Section kicker="How we work" title="Three principles, applied the same way every time">
    <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <div class="h-1 w-10 bg-cyan mb-4"></div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy text-lg">Owned locally</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate leading-relaxed text-[15px]">
          A project belongs to the community that lives with it. Our role is to start it,
          guide it and step back. If it only works while we are there, it does not work.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="h-1 w-10 bg-cyan mb-4"></div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy text-lg">Built to last without us</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate leading-relaxed text-[15px]">
          Cooperatives, irrigation, trade schools, access to banking. Infrastructure and skills
          rather than distributions, because a distribution ends the day it stops.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="h-1 w-10 bg-cyan mb-4"></div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy text-lg">Environmentally honest</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate leading-relaxed text-[15px]">
          Self-sufficiency that exhausts the land is a delay, not a solution.
          Water, waste and soil are part of every plan we support.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <section class="bg-sand">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-20 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Honduras · 2020-2022</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-navy mt-3 rule-cyan">The Santa Cruz project</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-slate leading-relaxed">
          In the department of El Paraíso, the community set three goals with us: end extreme poverty
          in Santa Cruz, create local employment, raise literacy. Around those goals we supported a food
          cooperative, farmland under a five-year plan, an irrigation system, a trade school, access to
          banking, better water distribution and health care.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate leading-relaxed">
          The program is suspended today. A change of national administration in Honduras altered the
          operating conditions the project depended on, and we chose to pause rather than run a program
          we could not run properly.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6">
          <a href="/our-work/" class="navlink text-cyan hover:text-navy">Read the full record →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img src="/img/hero-agriculture.jpg" alt="A grower holding freshly harvested produce in a field" width="1920" height="1078" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-slate">Honduras. Photograph from our field reporting, 2021.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Section kicker="Where we stand" title="An honest status, not a campaign">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="prose-fbc text-[15px]">
        <p>
          Our Honduras programs, including Santa Cruz, are suspended. Following a change of national
          administration, the institutional conditions our work depended on are no longer in place.
          Pausing was our own decision, taken so that the community would not be left with a program
          we could no longer support properly.
        </p>
        <p>
          For Better Community USA remains active as a legal entity, maintains its filings and its board,
          and holds the record of what was built. When a new program opens, it will appear here with its dates.
        </p>
        <p>
          Field operations in Cuba are carried by <a href="https://canada.forbettercommunity.org">For Better Community Canada</a>,
          a separate legal entity with its own board and its own accounts.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-cyan pl-6 self-center">
        <p class="text-navy text-xl sm:text-2xl leading-snug font-medium">
          "To be sustainable, this project needs to be owned by Santa Cruz citizens.
          Our role is to instigate, assist and facilitate."
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider">Santa Cruz project plan, 2020</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <section class="bg-navy text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <p class="eyebrow">Field notes</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mt-3 mb-8 rule-cyan">Reporting from the ground</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {notes.map((n) => (
          <a href={`/field-notes/${n.id}/`} class="group border border-white/15 p-6 hover:border-cyan transition-colors">
            <p class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan">
              {n.data.date.toLocaleDateString("en-CA", { year: "numeric", month: "long" })}
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-lg mt-2 leading-snug font-medium group-hover:text-cyan transition-colors">{n.data.title}</h3>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8"><a class="navlink text-cyan hover:text-white" href="/field-notes/">All field notes →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
